%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant LSW as Local SW
    participant L as Local AOU_CORE
    participant R as Remote AOU_CORE
    participant RSW as Remote SW
    Note over L,R: ENABLED
    LSW->>L: local managers stop issuing, then DEACTIVATE_START = 1
    Note over L: waits for SLV_TR_COMPLETE = 1 (every local request answered) and the DEACTIVATE_TIME_OUT_VALUE quiet window
    L->>R: DeactivateReq
    Note over L,R: DEACTIVATE
    R->>RSW: INT_DEACTIVATE_START (a hint: remote managers may keep issuing)
    R->>L: DeactivateAck
    R->>L: AW/AR/W requests still issued by the remote managers
    L->>R: R/B responses, sent after the local DeactivateReq
    Note over L: keeps granting request credits until the remote DeactivateReq arrives
    Note over R: keeps granting R/B credits after its DeactivateAck while its requests are open
    RSW->>R: remote managers stop issuing, then DEACTIVATE_START = 1
    Note over R: waits for its SLV_TR_COMPLETE = 1 and its quiet window
    R->>L: DeactivateReq
    L->>R: DeactivateAck
    Note over L,R: DISABLED: both dies discard the credits they hold
